eamid": "76561198062763216", "personaname": "SgtBalanced", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198062763216/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 737, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 491, "last_played": 1774788144, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gunfire Reborn - Reborn", "timestamp_created": 1772892735, "timestamp_updated": 1772892735, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220075057", "author": {"steamid": "76561198969016437", "personaname": "LockeOfAllTrades", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198969016437/", "num_games_owned": 75, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 3668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 187, "playtime_at_review": 3079, "last_played": 1790118267, "avatar": "fc13bb1f59388dc6070a14f9224b6f697e08a4d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played this game on the Xbox few years back on Game Pass, suffice to say that I sank about a hundred hours into this addictive game. The best roguelike I've ever played!\n\nI don't remember much of the story to the game, but the GAMEPLAY IS WHERE IT HITS HARD. A collection of guns, all are great and support various playstyles. Multiple classes that unlock as you play the game more and abilities to permanently unlock too. This game also has a really cool art style, where text will pop up with each gun when you fire it like \"POW\" and \"FWOOP!\". \n\nEdit: so I've sank a few more hours on PC (\"a few more\" = 50+ hours now) and it's not recommended for 100%'ing the game. There's a lot of bugs that are prominent but the developers of this game has long since abandoned it, since they weren't aiming for a live service game. A bug I keep running into is dropping framerates when there's too many enemies on the hardest difficulty + the grappling hook gadget just simply not working sometimes. Like it'll grapple, but never pull me, which leaves me in a position vulnerable for the enemy bots.\n\nThis game is great, I love it a lot. But going to 100% achievements is a pain in my ass. But I still love the game. I recommend it for people who might sink a few hours into playing it once or twice. But 100%? Nope. Don't recommend it unless you're sane enough to tackle it.", "timestamp_created": 1772885455, "timestamp_updated": 1789093112, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220043153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028362123", "personaname": "Wgairborne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028362123/", "num_games_owned": 329, "num_reviews": 72, "playtime_forever": 773, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 707, "last_played": 1773191365, "avatar": "97f57b58d639bf7e7f0de30ba44f013c32281139"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely amazing roguelite shooter. 80+ guns, 45+ enemies, 7 classes, and one of the best soundtracks for a game I've ever heard. Gameplay feels immaculate, movement and fighting is excellent, progression is great. 11/10 game", "timestamp_created": 1772854331, "timestamp_updated": 1772854331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}